	$\inner{\xi_p}{\grad\,(f\circ g)(p)} = \xi_p (f \circ g) 
	= \left.\frac{\dd (f \circ g \circ \gamma)(t)}{\dd t}\right|_{t=0} 
	= \sum_{i=1}^m\alpha_i\left.\frac{\dd (g_i \circ \gamma)(t)}{\dd t}\right|_{t=0} 
	= \sum_{i=1}^m \alpha_i \cdot (\xi_p g_i) 
	= \sum_{i=1}^m \alpha_i \inner{\xi_p}{\grad\,[g(p)]_i}$, where $\alpha := \nabla f(q)$, $q := g(\gamma(t))$ and $g_i$ is the $i$-th component of $g$.
